      "body": "crACK faf819bf23e8752644695e332cc00413d94af938\r\n\r\nnit: the comment on `peer2.sync_with_ping()` (\"Sync with the 'net' thread which completes the disconnection fully\") is no longer correct given this PR update, since the ping doesn't guarantee peer1's deferred deletion has happened. The comment could be changed to something like \"Sync with the 'net' thread and confirm peer2's messages have been processed\".\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/faf819bf23e8752644695e332cc00413d94af938/test/functional/p2p_orphan_handling.py#L829",
